
.subckt astra_019_cmos_dynamic_comparator vdd VSS clk inp inn op on
CN on VSS 50f
CP op VSS 50f
M1 net0 inp net2 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M10 on clk vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=5u
M11 net2 clk VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M2 net1 inn net2 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M3 op on net0 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M4 on op net1 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M5 op on vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M6 on op vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M7 net0 clk vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=5u
M8 net1 clk vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=5u
M9 op clk vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=5u
.ends astra_019_cmos_dynamic_comparator
